          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "复制"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 4,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 4,
              "content": "<table><thead><tr><th><p><strong>类别</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>具体内容</strong></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>消费品</strong></p></td><td><p>玩具（如乐高迪士尼系列）、服装、文具、家居用品、电子产品配件等</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>食品饮料</strong></p></td><td><p>乐园限定餐饮、主题甜品、联名饮品等（如冰雪奇缘纸杯）</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>出版物</strong></p></td><td><p>绘本、漫画、杂志、教育类图书等</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>音像制品</strong></p></td><td><p>电影蓝光碟、原声音乐、迪士尼+流媒体内容</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、服务体验类",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 乐园与度假区服务",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
