              "type": "text",
              "content": "复制"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 9,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 9,
              "content": "<table><thead><tr><th><p><strong>服务名称</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>服务内容</strong></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>门票与尊享卡</strong></p></td><td><p>提供乐园门票、快速通行（如迪士尼尊享卡）</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>住宿服务</strong></p></td><td><p>上海、香港、东京等迪士尼主题酒店提供住宿、餐饮、接送服务</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>游客服务中心</strong></p></td><td><p>提供票务、失物招领、导览、无障碍服务、走失游客协助等</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 个性化与贵宾服务",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
